'''Contest of Champs''' (最強格闘技決定戦, ''Saikyō Kakutōgi Ketteisen'', '''Strongest Martial-Arts Finals''') is a 4-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 5.9 Update|Version 5.9]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 2.

==Effect==
Unit Attack UP (Sm): Cats' attack power increases by 10%.

